### Create single expense
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/expenses/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expense_cycle": "{{expenseCycleId}}",
  "expense_category": "{{expenseCategoryId}}",
  "description": "Mercado",
  "amount": "150.00",
  "type": "single_expense",
  "date": "2026-03-25"
}

### Create recurring expense
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/expenses/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expense_cycle": "{{expenseCycleId}}",
  "expense_category": "{{expenseCategoryId}}",
  "description": "Academia",
  "amount": "99.90",
  "type": "recurring_expense",
  "date": "2026-03-07"
}

### Update single expense (expense_category, amount, description and/or date)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/wallets/expenses/{{singleExpenseId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expense_category": "{{expenseCategoryId}}",
  "description": "Mercado atualizado",
  "amount": "180.00",
  "date": "2026-03-24"
}

### Cancel recurring expense series (remove root cycle and forward)
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/expenses/{{recurringExpenseId}}/cancel-recurring/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### List expenses by cycle (query param required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/expenses/?expense_cycle={{expenseCycleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}
